WEBVTT

00:00:06.210 --> 00:00:07.760
Taizou!

00:00:07.760 --> 00:00:08.640
Hey, Chiba.

00:00:09.060 --> 00:00:09.810
Got practice?

00:00:10.930 --> 00:00:12.850
Of course, silly!

00:01:46.360 --> 00:01:47.710
<i>Brr! It's cold!</i>

00:01:48.960 --> 00:01:51.130
<i>Maybe it'll start snowing soon...</i>

00:01:54.040 --> 00:01:55.350
<i>It's Taizou and...</i>

00:01:55.350 --> 00:01:56.960
<i>...Chiba-chan?!</i>

00:01:56.960 --> 00:01:58.700
Sure you don't want me to walk you there?

00:01:58.700 --> 00:02:00.730
I'll be fine.

00:02:00.730 --> 00:02:01.720
Take care!

00:02:07.480 --> 00:02:10.020
<i>Yeah, it's Taizou's house, all right.</i>

00:02:10.350 --> 00:02:14.440
<i>So if Chiba-chan left here,
then that must mean...</i>

00:02:14.790 --> 00:02:16.070
Wha—?!

00:02:16.070 --> 00:02:18.050
Taizou and Chiba-chan?!

00:02:18.050 --> 00:02:19.150
They're going out?!

00:02:19.430 --> 00:02:22.820
Well, I'm just guessing.

00:02:23.170 --> 00:02:24.530
You've gotta be kidding!

00:02:24.530 --> 00:02:27.940
I mean, all those two think
about is their sports teams!

00:02:27.940 --> 00:02:31.900
That's why they get along so well,
but has there been anything more?

00:02:31.900 --> 00:02:33.470
No. Nothing at all.

00:02:33.470 --> 00:02:34.590
Enough already.

00:02:34.590 --> 00:02:36.990
Get those handouts done!

00:02:36.990 --> 00:02:38.630
Fine.

00:02:38.630 --> 00:02:41.530
Sensei, sorry I'm late. I was cleaning up.

00:02:41.530 --> 00:02:43.390
Oh, that's fine.

00:02:43.390 --> 00:02:45.260
Chiba-san, you work on these too.

00:02:45.260 --> 00:02:46.350
Sure.

00:02:49.710 --> 00:02:50.270
What?

00:02:50.270 --> 00:02:51.540
Nothing.

00:02:51.540 --> 00:02:54.210
So you also forgot to do your homework?

00:02:54.210 --> 00:02:55.790
Don't tell me you're an idiot, too.

00:02:55.790 --> 00:02:58.350
Don't lump me in with you three stooges.

00:02:58.350 --> 00:03:00.200
I did mine, I just forgot to bring it.

00:03:00.650 --> 00:03:03.330
A lot happened yesterday...

00:03:03.330 --> 00:03:05.030
My head was in the clouds.

00:03:06.860 --> 00:03:08.650
I wonder what she means by "a lot".

00:03:08.650 --> 00:03:10.130
Dang, she's got it bad!

00:03:10.130 --> 00:03:13.030
Look, she keeps staring at that key holder.

00:03:13.030 --> 00:03:14.640
Maybe it's...

00:03:14.640 --> 00:03:16.810
...a gift from Taizou?

00:03:16.810 --> 00:03:18.280
Hey, Chiba-chan.

00:03:18.280 --> 00:03:20.870
Come to think of it, you were late today, too.

00:03:20.870 --> 00:03:21.830
Did something happen?

00:03:21.830 --> 00:03:22.470
He asked!

00:03:25.350 --> 00:03:28.720
My knee was feeling off,
so I went to the hospital.

00:03:28.720 --> 00:03:31.390
Well, it turned out to be nothing.

00:03:31.940 --> 00:03:33.240
Hm.

00:03:33.240 --> 00:03:35.890
Not "hm", stupid! Ask her more!

00:03:35.890 --> 00:03:37.570
Uh, but that feels kinda...

00:03:38.260 --> 00:03:40.780
Hey, you three stooges done yet?

00:03:41.070 --> 00:03:43.090
Not even close.

00:03:43.090 --> 00:03:45.140
You forget your homework too, Taizou?

00:03:45.140 --> 00:03:48.130
Nah, I just handed in my Physics
notes instead, by accident.

00:03:48.130 --> 00:03:49.480
Trade you, Sensei.

00:03:49.480 --> 00:03:50.250
Sure thing.

00:03:52.310 --> 00:03:54.310
Huh? Hey, Chiba's here, too!

00:03:54.310 --> 00:03:55.380
No volleyball today?

00:03:55.380 --> 00:03:56.080
Hm?

00:03:56.980 --> 00:03:58.040
I'm taking a break.

00:03:58.040 --> 00:03:59.510
Oh.

00:03:59.510 --> 00:04:00.420
Really?

00:04:01.000 --> 00:04:02.340
Sounds nice.

00:04:02.340 --> 00:04:05.000
I'm off to Nishi High. Got a practice game.

00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:06.400
Good luck.

00:04:06.400 --> 00:04:06.890
Sure.

00:04:07.430 --> 00:04:10.470
Well, I'm off. But first...

00:04:10.470 --> 00:04:11.690
Keiichi, got a moment?

00:04:11.690 --> 00:04:12.770
Huh? What?

00:04:17.070 --> 00:04:19.410
This is Kei-chan's chance to ask him!

00:04:19.410 --> 00:04:20.860
Ask who? About what?

00:04:23.550 --> 00:04:26.780
Hey, Katakura, what were
you two talking about?

00:04:27.260 --> 00:04:28.240
Well, Taizou was...

00:04:28.240 --> 00:04:29.830
...just returning my porn mag!

00:04:29.830 --> 00:04:31.040
Ow!

00:04:31.040 --> 00:04:32.910
That was all?

00:04:32.910 --> 00:04:34.460
Yeah, just that.

00:04:34.750 --> 00:04:35.920
Hm.

00:04:35.920 --> 00:04:37.920
She's interested...

00:04:37.920 --> 00:04:40.380
Confiscated! Now finish those handouts!

00:04:40.650 --> 00:04:42.460
Fine...

00:04:42.730 --> 00:04:44.060
It's getting dark out.

00:04:44.060 --> 00:04:46.160
So I'll drive you all home once you're done.

00:04:46.160 --> 00:04:48.430
Lucky us!
Nice!

00:04:52.910 --> 00:04:55.140
Hey, Nii-chan, let's stop by
somewhere on the way back.

00:04:55.140 --> 00:04:58.060
"Somewhere"? Well, I guess I don't mind.

00:04:58.510 --> 00:05:00.610
You're cool with that, Chiba-chan?

00:05:00.970 --> 00:05:02.570
Okay!

00:05:02.570 --> 00:05:04.560
Then it's settled!

00:05:10.230 --> 00:05:12.770
Wow, I haven't been here in some time!

00:05:12.770 --> 00:05:14.070
Can you hit the ball?

00:05:14.070 --> 00:05:14.700
Of course I can!

00:05:14.700 --> 00:05:16.830
He's paying! Yay!

00:05:20.720 --> 00:05:23.170
Don't underestimate a guy
who played baseball as a kid!

00:05:23.450 --> 00:05:24.530
Did he?

00:05:24.530 --> 00:05:26.770
In grade and middle school, I heard.

00:05:26.770 --> 00:05:28.900
Though lately, Kei-chan's
been able to hit his pitches.

00:05:28.900 --> 00:05:30.510
It's not like I was a pitcher!

00:05:30.510 --> 00:05:31.950
Move forward a little more.

00:05:31.950 --> 00:05:34.730
Grip the floor with your right big toe.

00:05:34.730 --> 00:05:35.440
Okay.

00:05:35.440 --> 00:05:37.640
Swing once the ball's in front of you.

00:05:37.640 --> 00:05:38.190
Okay.

00:05:39.360 --> 00:05:42.670
Katakura-sensei's nice to Tsuyopon.

00:05:42.670 --> 00:05:43.670
I know, right?

00:05:52.450 --> 00:05:54.150
Think I can hit it?

00:05:54.150 --> 00:05:56.440
I'm not sure, it's been a while...

00:05:56.440 --> 00:05:57.370
He's lying.

00:05:57.370 --> 00:06:00.960
He said he came by here recently
on his way home from drinking.

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:02.480
Shut up, Keiichi!

00:06:06.920 --> 00:06:08.680
I'll get one, too!

00:06:11.270 --> 00:06:13.390
So, is your knee doing okay?

00:06:13.390 --> 00:06:15.220
Yeah, it's fine.

00:06:15.910 --> 00:06:18.620
Really, it was just my imagination.

00:06:18.620 --> 00:06:20.850
It's more like I was faking it.

00:06:20.850 --> 00:06:22.270
Faking it, huh?

00:06:22.270 --> 00:06:22.910
Right!

00:06:22.910 --> 00:06:26.730
Today was supposed to be
volleyball training, but I skipped out.

00:06:29.200 --> 00:06:30.490
In a recent game...

00:06:31.160 --> 00:06:33.910
I just kept making mistakes.

00:06:34.580 --> 00:06:37.100
We lost in a way we never should have.

00:06:37.100 --> 00:06:39.080
That left me feeling a little down.

00:06:40.630 --> 00:06:43.910
So I needed to refresh my spirits.

00:06:43.910 --> 00:06:45.420
It was a good change of pace.

00:06:45.420 --> 00:06:47.460
Glad to hear it!

00:06:47.460 --> 00:06:49.760
Taizou was worried about you earlier.

00:06:50.420 --> 00:06:53.890
Chiba hasn't been doing so well lately,

00:06:53.890 --> 00:06:55.930
but I can't take time off from practice.

00:06:56.410 --> 00:06:59.010
Could you cheer her up in my place?

00:06:59.010 --> 00:07:01.940
Oh, and this mag's really not my thing,

00:07:02.470 --> 00:07:03.210
So he said.

00:07:05.130 --> 00:07:06.660
So I see.

00:07:06.660 --> 00:07:08.850
He's such a great guy.

00:07:08.850 --> 00:07:11.280
Yeah, he's always been like that.

00:07:11.530 --> 00:07:12.420
All right!

00:07:12.420 --> 00:07:13.860
Guess I'll go hit a few more!

00:07:13.860 --> 00:07:15.620
Thinking of doing 140 too, Chiba-chan?

00:07:15.620 --> 00:07:18.170
Oh? We'll see about that!

00:07:19.750 --> 00:07:21.120
Everyone finished?

00:07:21.120 --> 00:07:22.450
Time to go.

00:07:22.450 --> 00:07:23.710
Okay!

00:07:28.880 --> 00:07:30.880
Wait! It's gone!

00:07:30.880 --> 00:07:31.630
What's gone?

00:07:31.630 --> 00:07:32.130
Your wallet?

00:07:32.130 --> 00:07:33.250
My key holder!

00:07:33.250 --> 00:07:34.710
Huh? It's right there.

00:07:34.710 --> 00:07:36.820
No, the volleyball one!

00:07:36.820 --> 00:07:37.970
I had it on here, too!

00:07:38.370 --> 00:07:39.690
Oh, that one.

00:07:39.690 --> 00:07:42.060
Um... Is it important to you?

00:07:42.060 --> 00:07:43.310
It was a gift.

00:07:43.310 --> 00:07:44.910
Knew it!

00:07:44.910 --> 00:07:45.850
What'll I do?

00:07:45.850 --> 00:07:47.690
I must've dropped it somewhere!

00:07:47.690 --> 00:07:49.570
About how large is it?

00:07:49.880 --> 00:07:51.470
Fist-sized.

00:07:51.470 --> 00:07:53.110
That's pretty big.

00:07:53.710 --> 00:07:56.620
Something that large
should be pretty noticeable.

00:07:56.620 --> 00:07:58.270
It might be in the car.

00:07:58.270 --> 00:07:59.830
I'll go check.

00:08:00.280 --> 00:08:01.880
I'll look over this way.

00:08:01.880 --> 00:08:03.750
I'll go that way!

00:08:04.210 --> 00:08:05.250
Not here!

00:08:05.250 --> 00:08:05.960
It's not here!

00:08:07.130 --> 00:08:10.000
<i>Crap! I can't find it anywhere!</i>

00:08:11.670 --> 00:08:13.760
<i>Does this mean...</i>

00:08:14.070 --> 00:08:17.140
<i>...it wasn't right for me after all?</i>

00:08:17.820 --> 00:08:19.680
<i>There's nothing I can do now.</i>

00:08:21.270 --> 00:08:23.110
Chiba-chan, did you find it?

00:08:23.110 --> 00:08:24.820
No, I didn't.

00:08:24.820 --> 00:08:26.390
It wasn't in the car, either.

00:08:26.390 --> 00:08:28.020
Or over here.

00:08:29.640 --> 00:08:30.440
That's fine.

00:08:31.010 --> 00:08:33.570
Sorry to make you help me look. Let's go.

00:08:33.570 --> 00:08:34.860
Don't give me that.

00:08:35.450 --> 00:08:37.780
Your face doesn't say "fine" at all.

00:08:38.260 --> 00:08:40.450
Wasn't it a gift from Taizou?

00:08:40.890 --> 00:08:42.040
Taizou?

00:08:43.040 --> 00:08:44.000
It wasn't?

00:08:44.970 --> 00:08:45.950
Chiba!

00:08:45.950 --> 00:08:47.070
Chiba-chan.

00:08:47.070 --> 00:08:48.360
This is for you!

00:08:48.360 --> 00:08:50.180
Keep on doing your best, okay?

00:08:50.180 --> 00:08:53.440
Even once we've graduated,
we'll still be cheering for you!

00:08:53.440 --> 00:08:55.300
No...

00:08:55.300 --> 00:08:59.300
It was a gift from my precious teammates.

00:09:00.450 --> 00:09:02.680
Oh... So that's what it was.

00:09:04.280 --> 00:09:04.890
Well, then!

00:09:05.290 --> 00:09:07.070
All the more reason we've gotta find it!

00:09:07.070 --> 00:09:08.730
If we keep looking,
I'm sure it'll turn up!

00:09:09.540 --> 00:09:10.800
Maybe it's in the parking lot!

00:09:10.800 --> 00:09:12.680
It likely rolled off to a strange spot.

00:09:12.680 --> 00:09:14.420
Let's check under the
vending machines too, then.

00:09:15.560 --> 00:09:17.030
Come on, Chiba-chan!

00:09:17.030 --> 00:09:18.320
Right!

00:09:20.580 --> 00:09:21.920
<i>That's right.</i>

00:09:21.920 --> 00:09:23.980
<i>I can't just give it up.</i>

00:09:23.980 --> 00:09:27.880
<i>I mean, it's supposed to
encourage me from here on.</i>

00:09:27.880 --> 00:09:29.740
<i>So, please...</i>

00:09:29.740 --> 00:09:31.020
<i>Let me find it!</i>

00:09:33.450 --> 00:09:35.380
<i>It's really not here.</i>

00:09:36.090 --> 00:09:37.980
<i>Why did this happen?</i>

00:09:37.980 --> 00:09:41.330
<i>How could I have dropped something
so precious without noticing?</i>

00:09:41.330 --> 00:09:44.750
<i>Maybe I really am an idiot!</i>

00:09:44.750 --> 00:09:45.220
Chiba.

00:09:46.290 --> 00:09:46.980
Hey.

00:09:49.010 --> 00:09:50.440
Taizou?

00:09:53.360 --> 00:09:55.650
Huh? That's...!

00:09:55.650 --> 00:09:57.250
My...!

00:09:57.250 --> 00:09:58.630
Why do you have it?!

00:09:58.630 --> 00:10:00.530
It was in the school parking lot.

00:10:01.410 --> 00:10:03.180
At school?

00:10:03.180 --> 00:10:05.370
I found it on my way back from the game.

00:10:05.640 --> 00:10:08.670
I heard it was important
to you, so I brought it.

00:10:08.670 --> 00:10:09.790
Here.

00:10:10.810 --> 00:10:12.860
Must be nice, playing around
at the batting range.

00:10:12.860 --> 00:10:14.730
Oh, thanks!

00:10:14.730 --> 00:10:17.220
I'm sure there'll be hard times ahead.

00:10:17.880 --> 00:10:19.800
But I know you can pull through.

00:10:20.270 --> 00:10:21.920
Let's both do our best, Captain!

00:10:23.350 --> 00:10:24.180
Yeah!

00:10:25.310 --> 00:10:27.210
Sorry, my senpais...

00:10:27.210 --> 00:10:29.810
I lost my confidence for a while there,

00:10:29.810 --> 00:10:33.110
but I've got my nerve back,
and I'll work hard for the team!

00:10:33.770 --> 00:10:36.720
I really asked a lot of you all there...

00:10:36.720 --> 00:10:38.240
Sorry for the bother.

00:10:38.240 --> 00:10:40.990
To think she dropped it at school...

00:10:41.250 --> 00:10:43.900
I was surprised to hear that
you're the team captain.

00:10:43.900 --> 00:10:45.330
That's impressive!

00:10:45.330 --> 00:10:46.910
Taizou's one, too.

00:10:47.190 --> 00:10:50.880
So I've been asking him
for advice on a bunch of stuff.

00:10:50.880 --> 00:10:52.830
Not that I've had anything
that helpful to say.

00:10:52.830 --> 00:10:54.470
Is that all?

00:10:54.470 --> 00:10:57.490
We've been thinking you two were an item.

00:10:57.490 --> 00:10:58.790
Oh, no, no!

00:10:58.790 --> 00:11:00.430
Our brains are full of sports stuff!

00:11:00.430 --> 00:11:02.180
I still think you'd make a good couple.

00:11:02.180 --> 00:11:03.270
Yeah!

00:11:13.850 --> 00:11:15.130
<i>Tch.</i>

00:11:15.130 --> 00:11:17.770
<i>She figured it out, huh?</i>

00:11:17.770 --> 00:11:19.980
Wow, it's snowing!

00:11:19.980 --> 00:11:21.200
Whoa, you're right!

00:11:21.200 --> 00:11:23.620
It must be cold.

00:11:23.620 --> 00:11:25.700
Even in the cold, sports gets me fired up!

00:11:25.700 --> 00:11:27.120
As expected!
